Do you remember when we were young\
Tip rats, slum cats, played fierce as wild fires rage\
Safe in the golden glow of youth each day\
\
Cardboard box castles, dirty blanket royal robes\
Stab city broken streets or Rivendell home\
Safe in the golden glow of youth each day\
