You forgot the things we learned\
\
In the fields down below\
Where the rivers ran down the the sea\
Sun too hot cooled by Lorien streams\
Emerald grass to golden sand\
I stood alone in the house of our dreams\
\
I sailed scolar ships far away \
To the place of crystal towers, \
Honey, joy and hardship\
Days long years fly I learned\
A day can feel like a lifetime, lifetime less than a day\
Time is the thing life takes away we can never get back\
Time spun me away from you\
\
But I kept the fields down below\
Where the rivers run down the the sea\
Emerald grass to golden sands\
I lived in the house of dreams we built\
Without your there\
